sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User / Adapter
    participant I as Canonical Intake
    participant P as Policy + Router
    participant J as Job Runner
    participant H as Processor Host
    participant S as Stores
    U->>I: Source + requested intent
    I->>S: Capture and immutable SourceAsset
    I->>P: capability + consent + limits
    P->>S: policy snapshot + route decision
    P->>J: create ProcessingJob
    J->>H: typed inputs + session secret
    H-->>J: typed outputs + usage + warnings
    J->>S: ProcessingRun + Representations + Candidates
    J-->>U: inspectable partial/final state
